  "swap": "Busoni swaps the G-major fugues between the books: this fugue (Book II no. 15, BWV 884) is printed in his Book I volume as Fuga XV (footnote 1: \"Diese Fuge ist ursprünglich die 15. des zweiten Bandes\", exchanged for technical/pedagogic reasons, with a Compositions-Studie and a Studio Rondo built on it), and Book I's G-major fugue appears in his Book II volume. Transcribed from the Book I volume (busoni.pdf, pdf p.90–91)."
